        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Central/paraspinal lumbar ache with deep stiffness for about 3 months, more noticeable for 4–6 weeks and worsening over the last month; baseline 3/10, flares to 6/10. Worse with standing and walking; better with sitting and stretching. Morning stiffness lasts about 10 minutes then eases. No clear injury; patient thinks a softer new mattress and long periods at the computer may contribute."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
